{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃色暴雨警告信號現正生效。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.RAIN 0731 LONG VIDEO.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026mbQD7beU1A1785202982.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.RAIN 0731 LONG VIDEO.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台指，一道廣闊低壓槽正為南海北部及廣東沿岸帶來驟雨及雷暴。預測今日天氣大致多雲，間中有驟雨及幾陣雷暴，初時雨勢有時頗大，日間最高氣溫約30度，明日部分地區雨勢較大，隨後一兩日天氣仍然不穩定。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受一股偏南氣流影響，周末期間廣東沿岸仍有幾陣驟雨，短暫時間有陽光。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T02:38:12.176148+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}